sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Entra / Okta
    participant L as SCIM library
    participant S as Host store
    participant A as Session service
    participant R as Reconciler
    C->>L: PATCH active=false
    L->>S: replace(doc, expected v7, events=[Deactivated])
    Note over S: one transaction:<br/>active=false + revocation intent
    Note over S: new sign-ins fail from here<br/>(auth reads this store)
    S->>A: inline attempt: revoke sessions, tokens, API keys
    alt revocation succeeds
        A-->>S: done
        S->>S: mark intent complete
    else fails or times out
        A-->>S: error
        Note over S: intent stays pending
    end
    S-->>L: committed (v8, revision 42)
    L-->>C: 200 / 204
    Note over R,A: later, independent of any client retry,<br/>including after a crash
    R->>A: revoke for each pending intent (idempotent)
    A-->>R: done
    R->>S: mark intent complete
